{"data":[{"type":"posts","id":"282213","links":{"self":"/posts/282213"},"attributes":{"number":1,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T23:15:53+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<p>GrapheneOS version 2026111800 released:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://grapheneos.org/releases#2026111800\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">https://grapheneos.org/releases#2026111800</a></p>\n\n<p>See the linked release notes for a summary of the improvements over the previous release.</p>\n","renderFailed":null,"editedAt":null,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canLike":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"likesCount":30},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"43608"}},"editedUser":{"data":null},"hiddenUser":{"data":null},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"15"}}}},{"type":"posts","id":"282235","links":{"self":"/posts/282235"},"attributes":{"number":2,"createdAt":"2026-11-19T00:41:32+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<p>google pushed pixek nov update to aosp?</p>","renderFailed":null,"editedAt":null,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canLike":false,"mentionedByCount":2,"likesCount":0},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"43608"}},"editedUser":{"data":null},"hiddenUser":{"data":null},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"27322"}}}},{"type":"posts","id":"282241","links":{"self":"/posts/282241"},"attributes":{"number":3,"createdAt":"2026-11-19T03:00:13+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<p><a href=\"https://discuss.grapheneos.org/d/43608-grapheneos-version-2026111800-released/2\" class=\"PostMention\" data-id=\"282235\"><i class=\"icon fas fa-reply\"></i>pizzadequeso</a></p> \n\n<p>No, I'm pretty sure AOSP has not changed since mid June with the initial release of android 17.</p>\n\n<p>GOS gets items like: Pixel firmware, drivers, HALs out of stockOS.</p>","renderFailed":null,"editedAt":null,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canLike":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"likesCount":5},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"43608"}},"editedUser":{"data":null},"hiddenUser":{"data":null},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"25693"}}}},{"type":"posts","id":"282246","links":{"self":"/posts/282246"},"attributes":{"number":4,"createdAt":"2026-11-19T04:33:47+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<p>Works fine so far on 6a. Will report if I'll be running into issues.</p> ","renderFailed":null,"editedAt":null,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canLike":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"likesCount":1},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"43608"}},"editedUser":{"data":null},"hiddenUser":{"data":null},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"2232"}}}},{"type":"posts","id":"282248","links":{"self":"/posts/282248"},"attributes":{"number":5,"createdAt":"2026-11-19T04:54:20+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<p>First and foremost; fantastic work on backporting all of that code from QPR2, thank you!<br>\nThere are no issues on 2026111801.<br>\nThe update was done on my P6a, P7, Pixel Tablet and P9Pxl.<br>\nI haven't tried cellular and Play Services.</p>","renderFailed":null,"editedAt":"2026-11-19T04:56:44+00:00","canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canLike":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"likesCount":6},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"43608"}},"editedUser":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"3749"}},"hiddenUser":{"data":null},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"3749"}}}},{"type":"posts","id":"282265","links":{"self":"/posts/282265"},"attributes":{"number":6,"createdAt":"2026-11-19T10:01:21+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<p>P6a mobile network, Sandboxed Google Play. All seemingly good. Thank you.</p>","renderFailed":null,"editedAt":null,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canLike":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"likesCount":1},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"43608"}},"editedUser":{"data":null},"hiddenUser":{"data":null},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"25683"}}}},{"type":"posts","id":"282268","links":{"self":"/posts/282268"},"attributes":{"number":7,"createdAt":"2026-11-19T10:40:33+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<p>10a and 10Pro without problems... 👍</p>","renderFailed":null,"editedAt":null,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canLike":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"likesCount":2},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"43608"}},"editedUser":{"data":null},"hiddenUser":{"data":null},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"13976"}}}},{"type":"posts","id":"282274","links":{"self":"/posts/282274"},"attributes":{"number":8,"createdAt":"2026-11-19T11:39:10+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<p>All seems to be well on 8Pro as well so far.<br>\nThanks the team and everybody involved for making it all possible!<br>\n❤️</p>","renderFailed":null,"editedAt":null,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canLike":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"likesCount":3},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"43608"}},"editedUser":{"data":null},"hiddenUser":{"data":null},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"2232"}}}},{"type":"posts","id":"282298","links":{"self":"/posts/282298"},"attributes":{"number":11,"createdAt":"2026-11-19T14:42:58+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<p>No issues on my 10 Pro XL</p> ","renderFailed":null,"editedAt":null,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canLike":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"likesCount":2},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"43608"}},"editedUser":{"data":null},"hiddenUser":{"data":null},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"3543"}}}},{"type":"posts","id":"282371","links":{"self":"/posts/282371"},"attributes":{"number":16,"createdAt":"2026-11-19T19:52:37+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<p>Thx for legacy extended support of my daily driver 6P 😘<br>\nNo issues so far on beta with 6P and tablet ...</p>","renderFailed":null,"editedAt":null,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canLike":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"likesCount":2},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"43608"}},"editedUser":{"data":null},"hiddenUser":{"data":null},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"33244"}}}},{"type":"posts","id":"282385","links":{"self":"/posts/282385"},"attributes":{"number":17,"createdAt":"2026-11-19T21:30:11+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<p>All running fine on my 10a</p>","renderFailed":null,"editedAt":null,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canLike":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"likesCount":3},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"43608"}},"editedUser":{"data":null},"hiddenUser":{"data":null},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"207"}}}},{"type":"posts","id":"282399","links":{"self":"/posts/282399"},"attributes":{"number":18,"createdAt":"2026-11-19T23:50:55+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<p>still possible to scan a qr code... When phone is locked. quishing protected ?</p>","renderFailed":null,"editedAt":"2026-11-19T23:54:14+00:00","canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canLike":false,"mentionedByCount":1,"likesCount":1},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"43608"}},"editedUser":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"38846"}},"hiddenUser":{"data":null},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"38846"}}}},{"type":"posts","id":"282408","links":{"self":"/posts/282408"},"attributes":{"number":19,"createdAt":"2026-11-20T02:20:34+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<p><a href=\"https://discuss.grapheneos.org/d/43608-grapheneos-version-2026111800-released/18\" class=\"PostMention\" data-id=\"282399\"><i class=\"icon fas fa-reply\"></i>whoareyou</a> It's only possible if you explicitly enabled the tile for it. We haven't decided if it should permitted or not when doing that yet.</p>","renderFailed":null,"editedAt":null,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canLike":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"likesCount":2},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"43608"}},"editedUser":{"data":null},"hiddenUser":{"data":null},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"15"}}}},{"type":"posts","id":"282416","links":{"self":"/posts/282416"},"attributes":{"number":20,"createdAt":"2026-11-20T03:06:32+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"<blockquote><p><a href=\"https://discuss.grapheneos.org/d/43608-grapheneos-version-2026111800-released/2\" class=\"PostMention\" data-id=\"282235\"><i class=\"icon fas fa-reply\"></i>pizzadequeso</a> google pushed pixek nov update to aosp?</p></blockquote>\n\n<p>You asked this same question five days ago: <a href=\"https://discuss.grapheneos.org/d/43522-grapheneos-version-2026111300-released/18\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" class=\"UrlLink UrlLink--internal UrlLink--discussion\"><span class=\"UrlLink-discussion\">#43522</span><span class=\"UrlLink-post\"><i class=\"icon fas fa-comment UrlLink-postIcon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>18</span></a></p>\n\n<p>The GrapheneOS team monitors release-announcement threads to hear about problems (or successes) with that release.</p>\n\n<p>When Google pushes A17 QPR2, the release notes for the relevant GrapheneOS release will mention that.  For example: <a href=\"https://grapheneos.org/releases#2025121000\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">https://grapheneos.org/releases#2025121000</a></p>\n\n<p>Until then, repeatedly posting queries in release-announcement threads that are not related to the release announcements does not seem to be a best practice.</p>","renderFailed":null,"editedAt":null,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canLike":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"likesCount":6},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"43608"}},"editedUser":{"data":null},"hiddenUser":{"data":null},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"2407"}}}}],"included":[{"type":"users","id":"2407","links":{"self":"/users/2407"},"attributes":{"username":"de0u","displayName":"de0u","avatarUrl":null,"avatarSrcset":null,"hasUploadedAvatar":false,"slug":"de0u","joinTime":"2023-01-12T21:13:53+00:00","discussionCount":16,"commentCount":10396,"canEdit":false,"canEditAvatar":false,"canEditCredentials":false,"canEditGroups":false,"canDelete":false,"anonymized":false,"canModerateExports":false,"canSuspend":false,"canViewBio":false,"canEditBio":false,"canViewWarnings":false,"canManageWarnings":false,"canDeleteWarnings":false,"canSpamblock":false,"visibleWarningCount":0}},{"type":"users","id":"25693","links":{"self":"/users/25693"},"attributes":{"username":"Johnnyloans","displayName":"Johnnyloans","avatarUrl":"https://discuss.grapheneos.org/assets/avatars/8kISEGEKi8V2AJUh.png","avatarSrcset":null,"hasUploadedAvatar":true,"slug":"Johnnyloans","joinTime":"2025-10-17T23:49:31+00:00","discussionCount":6,"commentCount":3756,"canEdit":false,"canEditAvatar":false,"canEditCredentials":false,"canEditGroups":false,"canDelete":false,"anonymized":false,"canModerateExports":false,"canSuspend":false,"canViewBio":false,"canEditBio":false,"canViewWarnings":false,"canManageWarnings":false,"canDeleteWarnings":false,"canSpamblock":false,"visibleWarningCount":0}},{"ty